{
  "sourceLanguage": "en",
  "strings": {
    "%lld Mac models": {
      "localizations": {
        "fr": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "%lld modèles de Mac"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "%lld files · %@": {
      "localizations": {
        "fr": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "%lld fichiers · %@"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "14-inch M4 or M5 (not Pro or Max)": {
      "localizations": {
        "fr": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "14 pouces M4 ou M5 (hors Pro et Max)"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Action": {
      "localizations": {
        "fr": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Action"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Actions": {
      "localizations": {
        "fr": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Actions"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "After about 10 seconds, release the three keys and keep holding power for up to 10 more seconds, until the Mac appears here.": {
      "localizations": {
        "fr": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Après environ 10 secondes, relâchez les trois touches en gardant le bouton d’alimentation enfoncé jusqu’à 10 secondes de plus, jusqu’à ce que le Mac apparaisse ici."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "All data on %@ will be permanently deleted.": {
      "localizations": {
        "fr": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Toutes les données de %@ seront définitivement supprimées."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "All models": {
      "localizations": {
        "fr": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Tous les modèles"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Apple Configurator is installed": {
      "localizations": {
        "fr": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Apple Configurator est installé"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Apple Configurator is required": {
      "localizations": {
        "fr": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Apple Configurator est nécessaire"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Apple silicon, 2025 or later": {
      "localizations": {
        "fr": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Apple silicon, 2025 ou plus récent"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Apple's reference table": {
      "localizations": {
        "fr": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Tableau de référence d’Apple"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Asks for a password": {
      "localizations": {
        "fr": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Demande un mot de passe"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Automatic DFU entry": {
      "localizations": {
        "fr": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Passage DFU automatique"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Automatic entry needs both Macs on Apple silicon, joined by their DFU ports, and an administrator password. You can skip the password in Settings.": {
      "localizations": {
        "fr": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Le passage automatique demande deux Mac Apple silicon reliés par leurs ports DFU, et un mot de passe administrateur. Vous pouvez vous en passer dans les Réglages."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Automatic entry needs both Macs on Apple silicon, joined by their DFU ports.": {
      "localizations": {
        "fr": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Le passage automatique demande deux Mac Apple silicon reliés par leurs ports DFU."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Available from Apple": {
      "localizations": {
        "fr": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Disponibles chez Apple"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Back": {
      "localizations": {
        "fr": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Retour"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Back: the leftmost USB-C port, seen from behind.": {
      "localizations": {
        "fr": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "À l’arrière : le port USB-C le plus à gauche, vu de dos."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Back: the middle USB-C port, seen from behind.": {
      "localizations": {
        "fr": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "À l’arrière : le port USB-C du milieu, vu de dos."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Back: the rightmost USB-C port, seen from behind.": {
      "localizations": {
        "fr": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "À l’arrière : le port USB-C le plus à droite, vu de dos."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "By hand, any USB-C port works on this Mac. Automatic entry needs its DFU port too.": {
      "localizations": {
        "fr": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "À la main, n’importe quel port USB-C de ce Mac convient. Le passage automatique demande aussi son port DFU."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Cable": {
      "localizations": {
        "fr": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Câble"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Cancelled.": {
      "localizations": {
        "fr": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Annulé."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Change…": {
      "localizations": {
        "fr": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Modifier…"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Check Now": {
      "localizations": {
        "fr": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Rechercher maintenant"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Check for Updates…": {
      "localizations": {
        "fr": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Rechercher les mises à jour…"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Check for updates automatically": {
      "localizations": {
        "fr": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Rechercher les mises à jour automatiquement"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Checksum mismatch: the file was deleted.": {
      "localizations": {
        "fr": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Somme de contrôle incorrecte : le fichier a été supprimé."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Come back here once it is installed.": {
      "localizations": {
        "fr": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Revenez ici une fois l’installation terminée."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Compatible with %lld Mac models": {
      "localizations": {
        "fr": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Compatible avec %lld modèles de Mac"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Connect the Mac, iPhone or iPad with a cable that carries data, then put it into DFU. The Port guide shows how.": {
      "localizations": {
        "fr": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Branchez le Mac, l’iPhone ou l’iPad avec un câble qui transmet les données, puis mettez-le en DFU. Le guide des ports explique comment."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Connect the device to flash with a cable that carries data, on its DFU port for a Mac. The Port guide shows which one.": {
      "localizations": {
        "fr": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Branchez l’appareil à flasher avec un câble qui transmet les données, sur son port DFU pour un Mac. Le guide des ports indique lequel."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Connect the device to this Mac with a cable that carries data.": {
      "localizations": {
        "fr": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Reliez l’appareil à ce Mac avec un câble qui transmet les données."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Continue": {
      "localizations": {
        "fr": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Continuer"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Corrupted": {
      "localizations": {
        "fr": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Corrompu"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "DFU Pulse": {
      "localizations": {
        "fr": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "DFU Pulse"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "DFU Pulse relies on Apple's free tool to talk to the device being flashed.": {
      "localizations": {
        "fr": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "DFU Pulse s’appuie sur cet outil gratuit d’Apple pour dialoguer avec l’appareil à flasher."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "DFU Pulse uses Apple's free Apple Configurator to install the system on the other device. It must be in your Applications folder.": {
      "localizations": {
        "fr": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "DFU Pulse utilise Apple Configurator, l’outil gratuit d’Apple, pour installer le système sur l’autre appareil. Il doit se trouver dans votre dossier Applications."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "DFU port": {
      "localizations": {
        "fr": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Port DFU"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Device": {
      "localizations": {
        "fr": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Appareil"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Device to flash": {
      "localizations": {
        "fr": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Appareil à flasher"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Disable": {
      "localizations": {
        "fr": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Désactiver"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Discard": {
      "localizations": {
        "fr": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Abandonner"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Done": {
      "localizations": {
        "fr": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Terminé"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Done. The device will restart on its own.": {
      "localizations": {
        "fr": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Terminé. L’appareil va redémarrer tout seul."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Done: no password will be asked.": {
      "localizations": {
        "fr": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "C’est fait : aucun mot de passe ne sera demandé."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Download": {
      "localizations": {
        "fr": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Télécharger"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Download and install updates automatically": {
      "localizations": {
        "fr": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Télécharger et installer les mises à jour automatiquement"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Downloads Apple's restore images once and keeps them on this Mac.": {
      "localizations": {
        "fr": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Télécharge une fois les images de restauration d’Apple et les garde sur ce Mac."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Each iPhone and iPad image fits only a few models. Only versions Apple still signs can be installed.": {
      "localizations": {
        "fr": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Chaque image iPhone ou iPad ne convient qu’à quelques modèles. Seules les versions encore signées par Apple peuvent être installées."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Earlier Apple silicon models": {
      "localizations": {
        "fr": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Modèles Apple silicon plus anciens"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Enable the helper": {
      "localizations": {
        "fr": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Activer l’assistant"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Enter DFU": {
      "localizations": {
        "fr": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Passer en DFU"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Enter DFU automatically": {
      "localizations": {
        "fr": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Passer en DFU automatiquement"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Enter DFU by hand": {
      "localizations": {
        "fr": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Passer en DFU à la main"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Enter DFU without a password": {
      "localizations": {
        "fr": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Passer en DFU sans mot de passe"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Erase and restore": {
      "localizations": {
        "fr": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Effacer et restaurer"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Erase this device?": {
      "localizations": {
        "fr": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Effacer cet appareil ?"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Flash": {
      "localizations": {
        "fr": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Flasher"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Flashing failed (code %d).": {
      "localizations": {
        "fr": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Échec du flash (code %d)."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Flashing in progress": {
      "localizations": {
        "fr": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Flash en cours"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Front": {
      "localizations": {
        "fr": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Avant"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Get it on the Mac App Store": {
      "localizations": {
        "fr": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "L’obtenir sur le Mac App Store"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Get started": {
      "localizations": {
        "fr": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Commencer"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Hinge": {
      "localizations": {
        "fr": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Charnière"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Hold the Home button and the side or top button together for 8 seconds.": {
      "localizations": {
        "fr": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Maintenez ensemble le bouton principal et le bouton latéral ou supérieur pendant 8 secondes."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Hold the Home button and the top button together for 8 seconds.": {
      "localizations": {
        "fr": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Maintenez ensemble le bouton principal et le bouton supérieur pendant 8 secondes."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Hold the power button for up to 10 seconds until the Mac turns off.": {
      "localizations": {
        "fr": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Maintenez le bouton d’alimentation jusqu’à 10 secondes, jusqu’à ce que le Mac s’éteigne."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Hold the side button and volume down together for 8 seconds.": {
      "localizations": {
        "fr": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Maintenez ensemble le bouton latéral et le bouton de volume bas pendant 8 secondes."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Hold the side button until the screen turns black.": {
      "localizations": {
        "fr": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Maintenez le bouton latéral jusqu’à ce que l’écran devienne noir."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Hold the top button until the screen turns black.": {
      "localizations": {
        "fr": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Maintenez le bouton supérieur jusqu’à ce que l’écran devienne noir."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "IPSW folder": {
      "localizations": {
        "fr": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Dossier des IPSW"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "If the screen shows a computer and a cable, the device is in recovery mode: it can be restored too.": {
      "localizations": {
        "fr": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Si l’écran affiche un ordinateur et un câble, l’appareil est en mode de récupération : il peut aussi être restauré."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "If this Mac asks to allow the accessory, click Allow.": {
      "localizations": {
        "fr": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Si ce Mac demande d’autoriser l’accessoire, cliquez sur Autoriser."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Import": {
      "localizations": {
        "fr": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Importer"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "In DFU mode the screen stays black. If the Apple logo appears, a button was held too long: start again.": {
      "localizations": {
        "fr": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "En mode DFU, l’écran reste noir. Si le logo Apple apparaît, un bouton a été maintenu trop longtemps : recommencez."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "In library": {
      "localizations": {
        "fr": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Dans la bibliothèque"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Install Apple Configurator": {
      "localizations": {
        "fr": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Installer Apple Configurator"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Intact": {
      "localizations": {
        "fr": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Intact"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Intel with T2 chip": {
      "localizations": {
        "fr": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Intel avec puce T2"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Keep both devices powered and connected.": {
      "localizations": {
        "fr": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Gardez les deux appareils alimentés et reliés."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Keep holding it while you plug the power back in, for up to 10 seconds, until the Mac appears here.": {
      "localizations": {
        "fr": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Gardez-le enfoncé en rebranchant l’alimentation, jusqu’à 10 secondes, jusqu’à ce que le Mac apparaisse ici."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Keep holding the side button and also hold volume down for 5 seconds.": {
      "localizations": {
        "fr": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Sans relâcher le bouton latéral, maintenez aussi le bouton de volume bas pendant 5 secondes."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Keep holding the top button and also hold the volume button farthest from it for 5 seconds.": {
      "localizations": {
        "fr": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Sans relâcher le bouton supérieur, maintenez aussi le bouton de volume le plus éloigné pendant 5 secondes."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Later": {
      "localizations": {
        "fr": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Plus tard"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Left": {
      "localizations": {
        "fr": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Gauche"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Left by DFU Pulse 0.4 and earlier, no longer used.": {
      "localizations": {
        "fr": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Laissée par DFU Pulse 0.4 et antérieur, plus utilisée."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Left side: the USB-C port closest to the front.": {
      "localizations": {
        "fr": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Côté gauche : le port USB-C le plus proche de l’avant."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Left side: the USB-C port closest to the hinge.": {
      "localizations": {
        "fr": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Côté gauche : le port USB-C le plus proche de la charnière."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Library": {
      "localizations": {
        "fr": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Bibliothèque"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Log": {
      "localizations": {
        "fr": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Journal"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Mac to flash": {
      "localizations": {
        "fr": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Mac à flasher"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Model": {
      "localizations": {
        "fr": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Modèle"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Move to Trash": {
      "localizations": {
        "fr": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Placer dans la corbeille"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Move to Trash?": {
      "localizations": {
        "fr": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Placer dans la corbeille ?"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "No IPSW yet. Download one below or drop files here.": {
      "localizations": {
        "fr": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Aucun IPSW pour l’instant. Téléchargez-en un ci-dessous ou déposez des fichiers ici."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "No compatible version found.": {
      "localizations": {
        "fr": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Aucune version compatible trouvée."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "No password needed": {
      "localizations": {
        "fr": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Sans mot de passe"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "No signed version for this model.": {
      "localizations": {
        "fr": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Aucune version signée pour ce modèle."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Not downloaded yet": {
      "localizations": {
        "fr": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Pas encore téléchargé"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Not enough free disk space: %@ needed.": {
      "localizations": {
        "fr": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Espace disque insuffisant : %@ nécessaires."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Not enough free space: Apple Configurator unpacks the image before installing it. Free up %@ on this Mac.": {
      "localizations": {
        "fr": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Espace libre insuffisant : Apple Configurator décompresse l’image avant de l’installer. Libérez %@ sur ce Mac."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Old sudo rule": {
      "localizations": {
        "fr": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Ancienne règle sudo"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "On the front, the USB-C port closest to the power button.": {
      "localizations": {
        "fr": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "À l’avant, le port USB-C le plus proche du bouton d’alimentation."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "On this Mac": {
      "localizations": {
        "fr": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Sur ce Mac"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "On top, the USB-C port farthest from the power button.": {
      "localizations": {
        "fr": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Sur le dessus, le port USB-C le plus éloigné du bouton d’alimentation."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "One file per version, shared by every Apple silicon Mac it supports.": {
      "localizations": {
        "fr": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Un seul fichier par version, commun à tous les Mac Apple silicon compatibles."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Only one USB-C port accepts DFU, and it depends on the Mac.": {
      "localizations": {
        "fr": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Un seul port USB-C accepte le DFU, et il dépend du Mac."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Open System Settings": {
      "localizations": {
        "fr": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Ouvrir Réglages Système"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Other Apple silicon models": {
      "localizations": {
        "fr": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Autres modèles Apple silicon"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Pause": {
      "localizations": {
        "fr": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Pause"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Platform": {
      "localizations": {
        "fr": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Plateforme"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Plug the cable into the DFU port, with nothing else in the USB ports.": {
      "localizations": {
        "fr": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Branchez le câble sur le port DFU, sans rien d’autre sur les ports USB."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Plug the cable into the DFU port. Leave only power connected otherwise, through MagSafe if the Mac has it.": {
      "localizations": {
        "fr": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Branchez le câble sur le port DFU. Ne laissez que l’alimentation branchée, en MagSafe si le Mac en a un."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Plug the cable into the DFU port. Leave only power connected otherwise.": {
      "localizations": {
        "fr": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Branchez le câble sur le port DFU. Ne laissez que l’alimentation branchée."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Port guide": {
      "localizations": {
        "fr": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Guide des ports"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Press and release power, then immediately hold left Control, left Option, right Shift and power together for about 3 seconds, until the Mac appears here.": {
      "localizations": {
        "fr": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Appuyez brièvement sur le bouton d’alimentation, puis maintenez aussitôt Contrôle gauche, Option gauche, Maj droite et le bouton d’alimentation pendant environ 3 secondes, jusqu’à ce que le Mac apparaisse ici."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Press and release power, then immediately hold left Control, left Option, right Shift and power together.": {
      "localizations": {
        "fr": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Appuyez brièvement sur le bouton d’alimentation, puis maintenez aussitôt Contrôle gauche, Option gauche, Maj droite et le bouton d’alimentation."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Press and release the volume button nearest the top button, then the other volume button.": {
      "localizations": {
        "fr": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Appuyez brièvement sur le bouton de volume le plus proche du bouton supérieur, puis sur l’autre bouton de volume."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Press and release volume up, then volume down.": {
      "localizations": {
        "fr": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Appuyez brièvement sur volume haut, puis sur volume bas."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Rack enclosure": {
      "localizations": {
        "fr": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Format rack"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Refused: this file is not hosted by Apple.": {
      "localizations": {
        "fr": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Refusé : ce fichier n’est pas hébergé par Apple."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Release the side button and keep holding volume down for about 10 seconds, until the iPhone appears in Flash.": {
      "localizations": {
        "fr": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Relâchez le bouton latéral en gardant volume bas enfoncé environ 10 secondes, jusqu’à ce que l’iPhone apparaisse dans Flasher."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Release the side or top button and keep holding Home for about 10 seconds, until the iPhone appears in Flash.": {
      "localizations": {
        "fr": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Relâchez le bouton latéral ou supérieur en gardant le bouton principal enfoncé environ 10 secondes, jusqu’à ce que l’iPhone apparaisse dans Flasher."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Release the top button and keep holding Home for about 10 seconds, until the iPad appears in Flash.": {
      "localizations": {
        "fr": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Relâchez le bouton supérieur en gardant le bouton principal enfoncé environ 10 secondes, jusqu’à ce que l’iPad apparaisse dans Flasher."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Release the top button and keep holding the volume button for about 10 seconds, until the iPad appears in Flash.": {
      "localizations": {
        "fr": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Relâchez le bouton supérieur en gardant le bouton de volume enfoncé environ 10 secondes, jusqu’à ce que l’iPad apparaisse dans Flasher."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Remove": {
      "localizations": {
        "fr": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Retirer"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Restore": {
      "localizations": {
        "fr": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Restaurer"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Restoring erases everything on this Mac.": {
      "localizations": {
        "fr": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "La restauration efface tout le contenu de ce Mac."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Restoring erases everything on this device and installs the version you choose.": {
      "localizations": {
        "fr": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "La restauration efface tout le contenu de cet appareil et installe la version choisie."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Restoring erases the device. If Activation Lock is on, its Apple Account password is needed afterwards.": {
      "localizations": {
        "fr": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "La restauration efface l’appareil. Si le verrouillage d’activation est actif, le mot de passe de son compte Apple sera demandé ensuite."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Resume": {
      "localizations": {
        "fr": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Reprendre"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Retry": {
      "localizations": {
        "fr": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Réessayer"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Revive": {
      "localizations": {
        "fr": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Raviver"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Revive keeps a Mac's data. Restore erases the device and installs the version you choose.": {
      "localizations": {
        "fr": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Raviver conserve les données d’un Mac. Restaurer efface l’appareil et installe la version choisie."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Revive or restore a Mac, iPhone or iPad that no longer starts, from this Mac, over a cable.": {
      "localizations": {
        "fr": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Ravivez ou restaurez un Mac, un iPhone ou un iPad qui ne démarre plus, depuis ce Mac, avec un câble."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Right": {
      "localizations": {
        "fr": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Droite"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Show compatible Macs": {
      "localizations": {
        "fr": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Afficher les Mac compatibles"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Show in Finder": {
      "localizations": {
        "fr": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Afficher dans le Finder"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Shows which port to use on each Mac, and the buttons for iPhone and iPad.": {
      "localizations": {
        "fr": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Indique le port à utiliser sur chaque Mac, et les boutons pour l’iPhone et l’iPad."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Status": {
      "localizations": {
        "fr": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "État"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Stop": {
      "localizations": {
        "fr": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Arrêter"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Stop flashing?": {
      "localizations": {
        "fr": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Arrêter le flash ?"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "T2 Macs take no macOS image here: Apple's tool picks the firmware, then macOS installs from Recovery.": {
      "localizations": {
        "fr": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Les Mac T2 ne prennent pas d’image macOS ici : l’outil d’Apple choisit le firmware, puis macOS s’installe depuis la récupération."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "The device may stay unusable until you flash it again.": {
      "localizations": {
        "fr": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "L’appareil risque de rester inutilisable jusqu’à un nouveau flash."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "The helper did not answer.": {
      "localizations": {
        "fr": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "L’assistant n’a pas répondu."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "The helper is a small part of DFU Pulse that macOS starts with administrator rights when needed. It only answers DFU Pulse and only puts a Mac into DFU. You switch it on once in System Settings › General › Login Items & Extensions.": {
      "localizations": {
        "fr": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "L’assistant est une petite partie de DFU Pulse que macOS lance avec les droits administrateur quand il le faut. Il ne répond qu’à DFU Pulse et ne fait que passer un Mac en DFU. Vous l’activez une fois dans Réglages Système › Général › Ouverture et extensions."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Then use “Enter DFU automatically” for a Mac, or the button sequence from the guide. The device shows up in Flash as soon as it is in DFU mode.": {
      "localizations": {
        "fr": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Utilisez ensuite « Passer en DFU automatiquement » pour un Mac, ou la séquence de boutons du guide. L’appareil apparaît dans Flasher dès qu’il est en mode DFU."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "To put the other Mac into DFU for you, DFU Pulse needs administrator rights. Switch its helper on once, and no password will be asked again for this.": {
      "localizations": {
        "fr": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Pour passer l’autre Mac en DFU à votre place, DFU Pulse a besoin des droits administrateur. Activez son assistant une fois, et aucun mot de passe ne sera plus demandé pour cela."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Tower enclosure": {
      "localizations": {
        "fr": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Format tour"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Turn on DFU Pulse under “Allow in the Background”, then come back here.": {
      "localizations": {
        "fr": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Activez DFU Pulse sous « Autoriser en arrière-plan », puis revenez ici."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Unplug the Mac from power, then press and hold its power button.": {
      "localizations": {
        "fr": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Débranchez le Mac du secteur, puis maintenez son bouton d’alimentation."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Updates": {
      "localizations": {
        "fr": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Mises à jour"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Updates come from the project's GitHub releases. They are signed and notarized, and installed when DFU Pulse quits.": {
      "localizations": {
        "fr": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Les mises à jour viennent des versions publiées du projet sur GitHub. Elles sont signées et notarisées, et s’installent quand DFU Pulse se ferme."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Updates the firmware and recoveryOS and keeps the Mac's data. Try this first.": {
      "localizations": {
        "fr": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Met à jour le firmware et recoveryOS en gardant les données du Mac. À essayer en premier."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Use a USB-C cable that carries data and charging. Thunderbolt 3 cables are not supported.": {
      "localizations": {
        "fr": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Utilisez un câble USB-C données et charge. Les câbles Thunderbolt 3 ne sont pas pris en charge."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Verify": {
      "localizations": {
        "fr": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Vérifier"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Verifying…": {
      "localizations": {
        "fr": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Vérification…"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Version": {
      "localizations": {
        "fr": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Version"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Version %@": {
      "localizations": {
        "fr": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Version %@"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Waiting for a device in DFU mode": {
      "localizations": {
        "fr": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "En attente d’un appareil en mode DFU"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Waiting for approval in System Settings": {
      "localizations": {
        "fr": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "En attente d’autorisation dans Réglages Système"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Welcome to DFU Pulse": {
      "localizations": {
        "fr": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Bienvenue dans DFU Pulse"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "With a Home button": {
      "localizations": {
        "fr": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Avec bouton principal"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Without a Home button": {
      "localizations": {
        "fr": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Sans bouton principal"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "You can also skip this: macOS will then ask for the password each time.": {
      "localizations": {
        "fr": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Vous pouvez aussi passer cette étape : macOS demandera alors le mot de passe à chaque fois."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "You're ready": {
      "localizations": {
        "fr": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Tout est prêt"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "iPhone 6s or earlier, and iPhone SE (1st generation)": {
      "localizations": {
        "fr": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "iPhone 6s ou plus ancien, et iPhone SE (1re génération)"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "iPhone 7 and iPhone 7 Plus": {
      "localizations": {
        "fr": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "iPhone 7 et iPhone 7 Plus"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "iPhone 8 or later, and iPhone SE (2nd generation or later)": {
      "localizations": {
        "fr": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "iPhone 8 ou plus récent, et iPhone SE (2e génération ou plus récent)"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "iPhones and iPads enter DFU with their buttons only.": {
      "localizations": {
        "fr": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Les iPhone et iPad passent en DFU uniquement avec leurs boutons."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "iPhones and iPads have no DFU port: plug any data cable into this Mac. They enter DFU with their buttons only.": {
      "localizations": {
        "fr": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Les iPhone et iPad n’ont pas de port DFU : branchez n’importe quel câble de données sur ce Mac. Ils passent en DFU uniquement avec leurs boutons."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "macOS lists the helper in System Settings › General › Login Items & Extensions. It only answers DFU Pulse, only puts a Mac into DFU, and you can switch it off there or in Settings.": {
      "localizations": {
        "fr": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "macOS affiche l’assistant dans Réglages Système › Général › Ouverture et extensions. Il ne répond qu’à DFU Pulse, ne fait que passer un Mac en DFU, et vous pouvez le désactiver là-bas ou dans les Réglages."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "macvdmtool is missing from the app.": {
      "localizations": {
        "fr": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "macvdmtool est absent de l’app."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "no longer signed by Apple": {
      "localizations": {
        "fr": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "plus signé par Apple"
          }
        }
      }
    }
  },
  "version": "1.0"
}